  "name": "Basics 4 · Sequencer and Quantizer",
  "description": "Clock steps the sequencer, the quantizer snaps every pitch to a scale, and the voice plays it. Edit any step pitch in the sequencer and it stays in key; change the Quantizer scale or root to re-colour the tune; change the clock BPM to speed up the delay too.",
